          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Transport, natural gas, pipeline, long distance
na;
UUID: a4273d5b-5258-343d-9462-8369960dc122
This dataset describes the energy consumption and the emissions linked to the transport of 1 tkm average natural gas in Europe.; Geography: The data for emissions and for energy requirements is based on German data.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Long-distance gas transport onshore with average compressor station.
Time period: The data for emissions is from 1994, the data for energy requirements from 2001.
Production volume: na
Sampling: statistics 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_a4273d5b-5258-343d-9462-8369960dc122.xml</text>
